# Chapter 35: a real TLS certificate with no domain purchase. sslip.io
# is a free, real wildcard-DNS service; 130-61-18-181.sslip.io resolves
# to 130.61.18.181, a real, publicly resolvable A record, so Let's
# Encrypt's own HTTP-01 challenge works against it exactly as it would
# against a bought domain. Caddy requests and renews the certificate
# on its own; nothing here is self-signed.
130-61-18-181.sslip.io {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8032
}
